4. Financing 
 
The works which form the subject invitation to tender shall be financed by the Functional Budget 
of the Ministry of Housing and Urban Development for the 2022 financial year,  
 
5. Provisional Amount 
 
The estimated amount of benefits is estimated at ninety eight millions FCFA (98 000 000). 
 
6. Consultation of the bidding documents 
 
The hard copy of the tender document may be consulted during working hours, upon 
publication of this tender invitation, at the Department of General Administration (Contracts 
service) of the Ministry of Urban Development and Housing located on the 9th floor-door 02 of 
the ministerial building N°1 (in front of Poste Centrale-Yaoundé) and the soft copy on the 
COLEPS 
platform 
at 
