7. Acquisition of the tender document 
 
The Tender document may be consulted and withdrawn upon publication of this notice at 
Department of General affairs (Contracts Service) of the Ministry of Housing and Urban 
Development located on the 9th floor, door 09T02 of the ministerial building N°1 (opposite the 
Central Post Office., on presentation of a receipt of payment of a non-refundable amount for the 
application fee of 100 000 (one hundred thousand) FCFA payable at Public Treasury. 
 
8. Submission mode  
 
The submission mode selected for this consultation is online or offline. 
 
9. Presentation of the offers 
 
Tenders shall be divided into three volumes and submitted in a simple envelope as follows: 
Volume 1: Administrative documents; 
Volume 2: Technical proposal; 
Volume 3: Financial offer. 
 
All the constituent documents (volumes1, 2 and 3) shall be enclosed in a large and sealed outer 
envelope bearing only the subject of the tender concerned. 
 
